\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$H=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $F$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${f}_{13}=1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $H$ is a diagonal matrix.  It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $H$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\n- $M$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $M$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ and $M$ are diagonal matrices." :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568894 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335968} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 11.834999999999999 :task-item/id #uuid "ebf81fff-00a9-4b5e-bd7c-9832b961a9a2" :task-item/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568895} :task-item/responses [{:answer/id #uuid "b0425408-bacb-5919-a589-b3081614a229" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467776} {:answer/id #uuid "6b0180d7-4a35-5c31-9d35-aabac4cbf98f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467779} {:answer/id #uuid "63692e72-3309-5f47-a7b7-d78cbf6d9dd4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 