wing is a $4\\times 3$ matrix?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n$$\nL = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nM = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & \\sqrt{2} & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nN = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "- The matrix $L$ has $4$ rows and $3$ columns. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 3.$ $\\,✓$\n\n- The matrix $M$ has $3$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 4.$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- The matrix $N$ has $2$ rows and $3$ columns. So, its dimensions are $2\\times 3.$ $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, only $L$ is a $4\\times 3$ matrix." :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501311 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335979} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 33.595 :task-item/id #uuid "c2965712-096e-450a-9bf8-8be7e2e38ec2" :task-item/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501312} :task-item/responses [{:answer/id #uuid "cec8f887-19d9-52c5-979c-41bdf97dea66" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438473} {:answer/id #uuid "993a2e57-e68d-5c06-aff9-837e0885e386" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438474} {:answer/id #uuid "27f3b618-f6c1-5133-b95f-4d62f222ef52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438476}] :task-item/status {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045571}}]} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335981 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096691 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c015dcaa-2155-5d80-985b-21924de92b28" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Vector Equalities" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050467 :topic/id #uuid "4bf7862e-8b34-577f-9a7c-1f3cc4989b50" :topic/math-academy-id 1102 :topic/title "Problem Solving Using Vector Diagrams"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e814a44-319a-5df8-9a03-ace37008c98f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467788} {:answer/id #uuid "27d5c20e-9612-5d23-998f-ddce41b64325" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467789}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "27d5c20e-9612-5d23-998f-ddce41b64325" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467789} :answer-field/id #uuid "99a2cbaf-a09c-530a-afc9-e5d245cdc7e7" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468615} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de3a0cc9-13ae-5f9a-8722-e8fcd8603d5d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467790} {:answer/id #uuid "9155a4c9-5c5a-5d7d-ac27-8342047b7dd7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467791}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9155a4c9-5c5a-5d7d-ac27-8342047b7dd7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467791} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb53a336-62d0-5988-ac15-39875035d9c3" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468616} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c01b7ec4-28bd-56d8-b466-8c85ed5b596b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467792} {:answer/id #uuid "af23767e-b6c8-57f7-af02-5b06f215c3d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467793}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c01b7ec4-28bd-56d8-b466-8c85ed5b596b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467792} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9a23cc7-eb26-5e7b-aaa6-27cfe3564b0c" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468617}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8c4b76bc-1da4-582d-a2ec-327744496809" :question/math-academy-id "q-69539" :question/problem "![](images/86/86aac25c634d29639329ae53209141ce81a3a82a70d42a4c2dfc6d356ee378b8.png)\n\nIn figure $ABCD$ shown above, which of the following are equal to the vector $\\overset{\\to }{DB}?$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{DA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC}+\\overset{\\to }{CB}$\n- $\\overset{\\to }{DA}+\\overset{\\to }{AB}$\n- $\\overset{\\to }{BA}-\\overset{\\to }{CA}+\\overset{\\to }{CD}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- For the $1$st expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC}+\\overset{\\to }{CB} & =(\\overset{\\to }{DA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC})+\\overset{\\to }{CB} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{DC}+\\overset{\\to }{CB} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{DB}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the $2$nd expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DA}+\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{DB}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the $3$rd expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{BA}-\\overset{\\to }{CA}+\\overset{\\to }{CD} & =(\\overset{\\to }{BA}-\\overset{\\to }{CA})+\\overset{\\to }{CD} \\\\  & =(\\overset{\\to }{BA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC})+\\overset{\\to }{CD} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{BC}+\\overset{\\to }{CD} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{BD} \\\\  & \\ne \\overset{\\to }{DB}\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."} {:db/id #ed